tools.example:
Application Library: Corrosion_Module/Cathodic_Protection/oil_platform, ship_hull, monopile and pipeline_corrosion_protection_iccp.
model.component("comp1").physics().create("cp", "CathodicProtection", "geom1");
model.component("comp1").physics("cp").feature("ice1").set("sigmal_mat", "userdef");
model.component("comp1").physics("cp").feature("ice1").set("sigmal", new String[]{"sigma", "0", "0", "0", "sigma", "0", "0", "0", "sigma"});

Application Library: Corrosion_Module/Cathodic_Protection/ship_hull (surface anodes) and pipeline_corrosion_protection_iccp (point anodes).
model.component("comp1").physics("cp").create("imprcs1", "ImpressedCurrentSurface", 2);
model.component("comp1").physics("cp").feature("imprcs1").set("Eimpr", "E_control");
model.component("comp1").physics("cp").feature("imprcs1").set("phisref_src", "root.comp1.cp.phisref_refel1");

Application Library: Electrodeposition_Module/Tutorials/al_anodization (experimental data) and Corrosion_Module/Galvanic_Corrosion/galvanic_corrosion_with_deformation (Corrosion material library).
model.component("comp1").func().create("int1", "Interpolation");
model.component("comp1").func("int1").set("source", "file");
model.component("comp1").func("int1").set("filename", "al_polarization_data.csv");
model.component("comp1").func("int1").importData();
model.component("comp1").func("int1").setEntry("funcnames", "col3", "iloc_Al");
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("es1").feature("er1").set("ilocmat_mat", "userdef");
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("es1").feature("er1").set("ilocmat", "iloc_Al(cd.Evsref,T)");

Application Library: Corrosion_Module/General_Corrosion/localized_corrosion_ls and localized_corrosion_pf; biodegradation_mg_stent; Electrodeposition_Module cu_trench_deposition_ls.
model.component("comp1").physics().create("ls", "LevelSet", "geom1");
model.component("comp1").physics("ls").feature("lsm1").set("epsilon_ls", "ls.hmax/8");
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").create("ics1", "ElectrolyteCurrentSource", 2);
model.component("comp1").physics("cd").feature("ics1").set("Qli", "i_loc*ls.delta");
model.study("std1").create("phasei", "PhaseInitialization");

Application Library: Electrodeposition_Module/Tutorials_with_Deforming_Geometries/cu_trench_deposition, cu_deposition_suppressor, inductor_coil and ecm_microbore.
model.component("comp1").multiphysics().create("desdg1", "DeformingElectrodeSurfaceDeformedGeometry", 1);
model.component("comp1").multiphysics("desdg1").set("Echem_physics", "tcd");
